    "body": "The second replacement is disabled and cannot be re-enabled. The right-stick value was correct, but the hook at `0x00558676` runs only in one conditional camera branch; FF8 uses different writers in other world-map camera states. That is why one arithmetic test passed while the live behavior still changed with the camera state. The selected mod and active patch now leave world-map input unchanged. The next implementation must run after the complete camera update, not inside one branch.",
